iewers reward reproducibility and calibrated claims far more than headline numbers.\n\n## Framing Priorities\n- Lead with the research question and the specific claim the evidence supports.\n- State the contribution precisely in the abstract and introduction: what is new, what it improves,\n  and under which conditions.\n- Motivate the method mechanistically. Explain why it should work, not only that it does.\ncapture.py\nevaluate.py\nprogram_0\nrequirements.txt\ntask.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44ca6864-ca3f-4cd8-8b55-d286cbe6e070","uuid":"9cfe8419-71e5-4fbe-962c-4b5e73443511","timestamp":"2026-11-11T08:07:05.164Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"['ablation_studies', 'all_programs', 'best_any', 'best_correct', 'evidence_sources', 'final_evaluation', 'generated_at', 'grounding_sources', 'idea_titles', 'improvement_trace', 'paper_profile', 'presentation_contract', 'results_dir', 'top_programs', 'totals']\nablation_studies []\nbest_correct {\"attempt_dir_name\": \"idea_root\", \"attempt_id\": \"c03_budget_prior_partition_ensemble_attempt_01\", \"combined_score\": 0.9854305898115931, \"correct\": true, \"eligible\": true, \"eval_index\": 3, \"evaluation_evidence\": {\"candidate_diagnostics_trust\": \"unverified\", \"episode_count\": 2, \"episodes\": [{\"correct\": true, \"duration_seconds\": 26.732067645949428, \"score\": 0.9839953297027199, \"seed\": 101}, {\"correct\": true, \"duration_seconds\": 23.18263845599722, \"score\": 0.9868658499204666, \"seed\": 102}], \"path\": \"work/results/t03/claude/20261111_071336/investigation/ideas/03_budget_aware_empirical_bayes_shrinkage_with_partition_ensembled_jackknife_for_single_run_kernel_shap_reliability/program_1/evaluation_evidence.json\", \"sha256\": \"sha256:17f45d2899164782ee33e7979e5f6730e3e50fe92227ee64c5b716574ae97896\", \"status\": \"available\"}, \"idea_dir_name\": \"03_budget_aware_empirical_bayes_shrinkage_with_partition_ensembled_jackknife_for_single_run_kernel_shap_reliability\"